# Runtime state the server rewrites while it runs; session.json also bakes in
# absolute paths. config.toml and plugin-src/ are the source.
#
# plugins/ and plugins.json are herdr's own managed plugin area -- the registry
# it rewrites on link/unlink, plus a per-plugin config dir it seeds itself.
# plugin-src/ is deliberately outside it so linked source and generated state
# do not share a directory.
*.log
*.sock
session.json
.plugins.lock
plugins/
plugins.json
